{"id":8974902984860,"title":"Camden Derby - Snuff","handle":"camden-derby-snuff","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"274\" data-end=\"559\"\u003eThe Camden Derby is built to handle whatever the day brings—versatile, practical, and effortlessly stylish. Designed with blucher-style lacing for a more casual look, it pairs just as well with denim as it does with chinos, making it an easy choice from office hours to weekends out.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"912\"\u003eThis new version is crafted in \u003cstrong data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"607\"\u003eSnuff Suede\u003c\/strong\u003e, a richly textured leather that softens beautifully with wear while maintaining rugged durability. Fully lined for structure and support, the Camden sits atop a \u003cstrong data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"798\"\u003eVibram #430 mini-lug sole\u003c\/strong\u003e with a leather midsole and storm welt—adding sophistication without sacrificing traction or weather resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"1058\"\u003eEvery pair is finished with \u003cstrong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"976\"\u003eBlake Welt Stitch construction\u003c\/strong\u003e and handcrafted in Maine, USA. A shoe made to be lived in, season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-04-13T15:44:13-04:00","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:44:13-04:00","vendor":"Rancourt \u0026 Co.","type":"Footwear","tags":["Best Sellers"],"price":39800,"price_min":39800,"price_max":39800,"available":true,"price_varies":false,"compare_at_price":0,"compare_at_price_min":0,"compare_at_price_max":0,"compare_at_price_varies":false,"variants":[{"id":46673087594652,"title":"8 \/ D \/ Snuff","option1":"8","option2":"D","option3":"Snuff","sku":"1302-68-8D","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":{"id":45887050121372,"product_id":8974902984860,"position":2,"created_at":"2026-07-09T19:16:39-04:00","updated_at":"2026-07-09T19:16:40-04:00","alt":null,"width":3000,"height":2999,"src":"http